sh.host_channel</code> table contains exactly:\\n\\n| Key | Required value / constraint |\\n| --- | --- |\\n| <code>version</code> | Exact <code>1.0.0</code> |\\n\",\n  \"original_output_bytes\": 1247,\n  \"original_output_tokens\": 312,\n  \"truncated\": false\n}","correlation_facts":{"tool_name":"bash","outcome":"success"}}}
